<title>USA: Reflectone sets May 20 for vote on merger.</title>
<headline>Reflectone sets May 20 for vote on merger.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reflectone Inc said Monday that it will hold a special shareholder meeting May 20 to vote on the proposed merger with British Aerospace Holdings, a subsidiary of British Aerospace Plc.</p>
<p>The record date for shareholders entitled to vote at the mneeting was April 14.</p>
<p>If approved, said the company, Relfectone shareholders will receive $24 per share. British Aerospace already owns 48 percent Reflectone's outstanding stock.</p>
<p>Reflectone designs, manufactures and sells filght simulators and training equipment for commercial and governmental customers.</p>
</text>
